    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired after stairs; no orthopnea or morning headaches</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slurred speech by evening; occasional cough with thin drinks; no drooling</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Weight 86.6 kg; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Weaker hands and left leg; no numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steadier since starting work; PHQ-9 6</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

