    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1939-10-19; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; blood pressure 118/74, pulse 76, oxygen saturation 97%; weight 86.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Moderate hand weakness (grip 3+/5); left ankle dorsiflexion 3/5; mild to moderate dysarthria; tongue fasciculations; brisk jaw jerk</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Clear; slight paradoxical abdominal movement when lying flat</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

